    "/answer_surface_v1/faq_blocks/0/question": {
      "format": "markdown",
      "sourceSha256": "4b32f394848d031063bf83a789114104e3c8ea9f3f264b23d739f1e99371cd35",
      "text": "開放性高的人一定更信任 AI 嗎？"
    },
    "/answer_surface_v1/faq_blocks/0/answer": {
      "format": "markdown",
      "sourceSha256": "1d78b4614b63ad9071e905ac52fd92b146e5b9dea789b1c4667df7295ee2f909",
      "text": "不一定。開放性可能與較高的嘗試意願有關，但信任仍會受到錯誤經歷、任務風險、隱私顧慮和專業知識影響。願意嘗試和願意交出判斷是兩件事。"
    },
    "/answer_surface_v1/faq_blocks/1/question": {
